@startuml
title IaC Tool - apply sequence

actor User
participant "CLI" as CLI
participant "Manifest Loader" as ManifestLoader
participant "Planner" as Planner
participant "Plan Executor" as Executor
participant "Yandex Cloud Facade" as Facade
database "state.json" as State

User -> CLI : iac-tool apply manifest.yaml --confirm
CLI -> ManifestLoader : load and validate manifest
ManifestLoader --> CLI : Manifest
CLI -> State : load state
CLI -> Planner : build_apply_plan(manifest, state)
Planner --> CLI : ExecutionPlan
CLI -> Executor : execute(plan)

loop for each command
  Executor -> Facade : create/delete cloud resource
  Facade --> Executor : resource id or completion
  Executor -> State : atomically save updated state
end

Executor --> CLI : executed commands
CLI --> User : plan result and live outputs
@enduml
